    {
      "id": "claim_e056f35803bf49f6b84e907b159f89d7",
      "statement": "The backend lifespan runs _verify_sql_catalog and raises RuntimeError when the SQL catalog allowlist disagrees with the database, so deploying code against an unmigrated schema produces a backend that fails to boot (logged as 'SQL catalog drift').",
