      "statement": "ci.yml is a separate workflow that runs on every pull request and push to master (backend ruff lint, unit and pgvector-Postgres integration tests, frontend lint, tsc, coverage run and build, with coverage uploaded to Codecov) and deploys nothing; deploy.yml neither waits for nor checks CI, so a manual dispatch deploys even a ref whose CI failed.",
