      "id": "claim_a6f3dbcd949a425a90b55f9417d40515",
      "statement": "The backend lifespan also opens the LangGraph checkpointer without running DDL: open_checkpointer raises RuntimeError ('run make migrate') when the database's checkpoint_migrations version differs from the one the installed langgraph expects, and `make migrate` applies db/migrations/*.sql and then the checkpointer tables, so a langgraph upgrade needs a migrate before deploy even with no new .sql file.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/app/core/lifespan.py#L195-L195",
